2351
02:36:47,280 --> 02:36:50,510
The teacher walked over and placed her hand on his desk.

2352
02:36:51,320 --> 02:36:58,240
She observed Pakistan hasn't even opened his report card. Maybe because Pakistan already knows the result it will read.

2353
02:36:58,320 --> 02:37:04,320
