2357
02:37:12,284 --> 02:37:13,240
Pakistan stayed behind.

2358
02:37:13,320 --> 02:37:19,320
Still arguing about yesterday. Still dreaming about a shortcut for tomorrow. Still refusing to open his books today.

2359
02:37:19,720 --> 02:37:24,315
The classroom slowly began to dissolve, the black and white mist lifted,

2360
02:37:24,395 --> 02:37:27,280
