2361
02:37:27,360 --> 02:37:31,440
I found myself sitting alone on that broken wooden bench.

2362
02:37:31,520 --> 02:37:37,920
The dust motes floating in the afternoon sun, the familiar hum of Karachi traffic outside,

2363
02:37:38,000 --> 02:37:40,000
