So it's from the same guy who wrote to me about, you remember GTAwali, GTA in Karachi?

2370
02:38:06,850 --> 02:38:10,440
Same guy. Fantastic man. You need to write a book man.

2371
02:38:13,040 --> 02:38:18,480
or like a collection of small essays. It's fantastic, super funny and very thought provoking.

2372
02:38:20,080 --> 02:38:26,680
And the interesting thing is that the garbage you have pulled, you can put it on every decade of Pakistan.

2373
