In the seventies, eighties, nineties, two thousand, two thousand ten and now the twentieth is also going to end.

2374
02:38:33,080 --> 02:38:36,680
It will fit everyone. We're doing the same things all over again.

2375
02:38:36,760 --> 02:38:38,760
I was.

2376
02:38:42,910 --> 02:38:47,830
Very hopeful at the start of my career that okay, you know Pakistan might change.

2377
02:38:47,910 --> 02:38:51,830
Internet has come, people have got awareness, people have voice, etc. etc.

2378
02:38:51,910 --> 02:38:56,830
But then, nah man, this is not a country that will ever fix.

2379
02:38:56,910 --> 02:38:59,830
So, keep this in mind.

2380
02:38:59,910 --> 02:39:02,875
And it has a very easy parameter,

2381
