2463
02:44:30,700 --> 02:44:37,620
Alright, next email says, single mom in Karachi, navigating toxic family, ghosted ex-husband and setting boundaries.

2464
02:44:37,700 --> 02:44:39,700
Hello, Junaid Bhai. Hope you're doing well. Sorry for the long email.

2465
02:44:39,850 --> 02:44:43,073
email but I really wanted to share my situation with you in detail.

2466
02:44:43,153 --> 02:44:45,751
My name is A B C and I am writing to you from Karachi.

2467
02:44:45,831 --> 02:44:47,467
I come from a middle class family.

2468
02:44:47,547 --> 02:44:49,086
I want to start by thanking you.

2469
02:44:49,166 --> 02:44:56,045
I regularly watch your content and ask and you select sessions and your perspective has given me so much strength through my hardest days.

2470
02:44:56,125 --> 02:44:58,017
May Allah reward you immensely.

2471
02:44:58,097 --> 02:45:02,569
Bless you with even more success and keep helping people through your channel.

2472
02:45:02,649 --> 02:45:07,030
I am reaching out because I feel completely suffocated at home.

2473
02:45:07,110 --> 02:45:10,030
and really need your advice on setting boundaries with my family.

2474
02:45:10,110 --> 02:45:14,496
To give you some background, back in 2020 at just the age of 21,

2475
02:45:14,576 --> 02:45:18,030
I got divorced after only 6 months of an arranged marriage.

2476
02:45:18,110 --> 02:45:25,030
My ex-husband divorced me while I was 4 months pregnant because he was in love with someone else and wanted to marry her.

2477
02:45:25,110 --> 02:45:28,110
Ah, how stupid of this guy.

2478
02:45:33,410 --> 02:45:35,330
So don't get pregnant, brother.

2479
02:45:35,410 --> 02:45:37,330
Oh man.

2480
02:45:37,410 --> 02:45:41,330
Okay, you wanted to marry him, so you got pregnant and left.

2481
02:45:41,410 --> 02:45:48,330
He knew I was carrying his child, yet he completely walked away and hasn't paid a single rupee for her to this day.

2482
02:45:48,410 --> 02:45:51,330
Okay, you didn't mention what was his age? You were twenty one.

2483
02:45:51,410 --> 02:45:53,330
So how old was he?

2484
02:45:53,410 --> 02:45:59,410
After finishing my iddat and having my daughter in twenty one, I went through severe postpartum depression.

2485
02:45:59,920 --> 02:46:05,160
At my lowest point, I had dark, terrifying thoughts because the emotional pain was just too much.

2486
02:46:05,240 --> 02:46:06,115
In our society,

2487
