2489
02:46:13,960 --> 02:46:16,280
Of course, I couldn't handle the noise.

2490
02:46:16,360 --> 02:46:19,840
This is what happens. Our culture is beautiful.

2491
02:46:19,920 --> 02:46:22,329
Despite all of that trauma, I survived.

2492
02:46:22,409 --> 02:46:26,095
Today in 2026, my daughter is 5 years old and I've rebuilt my life.

2493
02:46:26,175 --> 02:46:27,470
I finished my master's degree.

2494
02:46:27,550 --> 02:46:32,870
degree working online and earning between 90 to 120,000 rupees.

2495
02:46:34,840 --> 02:46:40,240
I handle all my daughter's expenses independently, including her schooling at a top institute.

2496
02:46:40,320 --> 02:46:45,760
To protect myself from financial strain, I had to tell my family that I only earn twenty thousand a month.

2497
02:46:45,840 --> 02:46:51,760
I knew that if I told them my actual income, they'd expect me to cover all the household utility bills and expenses.

2498
02:46:51,840 --> 02:46:53,760
You did the right thing.

2499
02:46:53,840 --> 02:46:55,760
You have said one seventh.

2500
02:46:55,840 --> 02:46:57,760
Absolutely right.

2501
02:46:57,840 --> 02:47:02,300
But because they think I only make twenty thousand, my father and my three younger unmarried.

2502
