married brothers constantly taunt me saying things.

2503
02:47:05,340 --> 02:47:08,260
You're working so hard and you're only getting twenty thousand rupees.

2504
02:47:08,340 --> 02:47:12,540
Before my mother passed away in twenty twenty four, things were different.

2505
02:47:12,620 --> 02:47:17,260
My mother was my shield and my father used to back me up as well.

2506
02:47:17,340 --> 02:47:20,180
But ever since we lost her, everything changed.

2507
02:47:20,260 --> 02:47:23,060
Over the years, our family's financial standing improved.

2508
02:47:23,140 --> 02:47:27,380
