2509
02:47:27,460 --> 02:47:29,390
Taunts like when my daughter had school.

2510
02:47:29,470 --> 02:47:32,282
school holidays and I slept in until 10 a.m.

2511
02:47:32,362 --> 02:47:42,979
They accused me of having bad habits and serving breakfast late even though my father and brothers don't even leave for their business at 1 p.m.

2512
02:47:43,059 --> 02:47:46,543
If I try to explain myself they say I'm talking back.

2513
02:47:46,623 --> 02:47:47,609
Cruel comments.

2514
02:47:47,689 --> 02:47:52,582
My brother recently said to me right in front of my 5 year old daughter,

2515
02:47:52,662 --> 02:47:54,700
ek aadmi ko apna nahi kar sakhi

2516
02:47:55,290 --> 02:48:00,650
They make these hurtful remarks without caring that my child is listening.

2517
02:48:00,860 --> 02:48:02,095
Targeting my daughter.

2518
