If something breaks by accident, even if it's an item I bought with my own money.

2524
02:48:23,140 --> 02:48:29,480
my own money or if I make a small mistake, I get berated for it endlessly. There is

2525
02:48:29,560 --> 02:48:33,860
no other woman in the house to share this load or stand up for me. I am physically

2526
02:48:33,940 --> 02:48:39,700
and emotionally drained from fighting for basic respect in a house where I support myself

2527
02:48:39,780 --> 02:48:45,880
and raise my child alone. How do I mentally detach myself from their constant criticism?

2528
02:48:45,960 --> 02:48:50,000
And how can I hold my boundaries firmly without feeling guilty or letting.

2529
02:48:50,080 --> 02:48:52,842
letting this environment affect my peace of mind.

2530
02:48:52,922 --> 02:48:57,867
I really hope you pick this up on Ask Ganji Swag and share your thoughts with me.

2531
02:48:57,947 --> 02:48:58,680
Warm regards.

2532
02:48:59,480 --> 02:49:07,480
This is a 21 year old woman who is pregnant and her husband is divorced.

2533
02:49:09,300 --> 02:49:11,220
I love someone else.

2534
02:49:11,300 --> 02:49:16,440
And yeah, and then my mother is also not here. She's the only girl in the house.

2535
02:49:16,520 --> 02:49:16,820
and three brothers who will be with us till 1 PM.

2536
02:49:16,900 --> 02:49:20,642
and three brothers who don't even go to their office until 1 PM,

2537
02:49:20,722 --> 02:49:23,683
but if they sleep till 10 PM on their days off,

2538
02:49:23,763 --> 02:49:29,990
they taunt them that why didn't you wake up and make breakfast and you couldn't even make one meal.

2539
02:49:30,520 --> 02:49:35,440
I think they are not your empathetic brothers.

2540
02:49:35,520 --> 02:49:37,663
Those who are good brothers, obviously,

2541
02:49:37,743 --> 02:49:42,682
take great care of this that our sister and if the only sister, you're the only sister,

2542
02:49:42,762 --> 02:49:44,470
so if this behavior is with her.

2543
02:49:44,550 --> 02:49:48,970
So when they bring a foreign woman in the future, what will be their behavior?

2544
02:49:49,050 --> 02:49:50,970
So may Allah have mercy on those women.

2545
02:49:51,050 --> 02:49:57,470
I hope you never partake in their selection because you will be blamed for it because you already know what your brothers are like.

2546
02:49:57,550 --> 02:49:59,550
So leave them to their own devices.

2547
02:50:04,300 --> 02:50:09,227
Now, the way you are taunting that you couldn't handle a man,

2548
02:50:09,307 --> 02:50:13,620
this is the least interesting metric to judge you.

2549
02:50:13,700 --> 02:50:18,420
A man who stayed for 4 months and he also said that he loves someone else.

2550
02:50:18,500 --> 02:50:23,300
That's not how you should be. First of all, you shouldn't be a judge.

2551
02:50:23,540 --> 02:50:25,568
But if you are, then why are they doing it this way?

2552
02:50:25,648 --> 02:50:31,340
Why aren't they seeing that you are single-handedly raising your own daughter and Mashallah you are working from home and you are making good money.

2553
02:50:31,420 --> 02:50:33,860
and they are earning good money and all that.

2554
02:50:34,420 --> 02:50:39,420
So again, they are putting their insecurity on you and not doing anything else.

2555
02:50:41,840 --> 02:50:45,140
And in this, it's not your failure.

2556
02:50:45,220 --> 02:50:52,340
If your husband was already someone else's, then it's not your failure to keep him.

2557
02:50:52,420 --> 02:50:54,340
He was never yours to begin with.

2558
02:50:54,420 --> 02:50:57,340
It was just the family that got him married to a goon.

2559
02:50:57,420 --> 02:50:58,930
And that's why I always say, please.

2560
02:50:59,010 --> 02:51:03,050
Please stay away from arranged marriages because you don't know who you're getting into.

2561
02:51:03,130 --> 02:51:05,650
Now she got you pregnant and left.

2562
02:51:05,730 --> 02:51:11,610
Now your life, I'm sure you love your daughter and I'm sure everyone loves their kids.

2563
02:51:11,690 --> 02:51:17,010
But in this kind of situation you can't make big bold decisions.

2564
02:51:17,090 --> 02:51:21,930
Once kids come into your life, you are tied to them.

2565
02:51:22,010 --> 02:51:24,890
You can't take this girl anywhere.

2566
02:51:25,800 --> 02:51:28,000
For example, you want to leave the country.

2567
02:51:28,080 --> 02:51:30,880
Or you want to explore a new life.

2568
02:51:30,960 --> 02:51:34,240
You can't because now you have this person to look after.

2569
02:51:36,360 --> 02:51:46,400
And I am happy to see that you are raising your daughter in a way that she thinks that you work hard and she keeps quiet and she plays with the activity set.

2570
02:51:54,140 --> 02:52:03,300
In our country, look, what should I say?

2571
02:52:14,060 --> 02:52:15,980
Clearly your brothers don't respect you.

2572
02:52:16,060 --> 02:52:19,184
And in the future when they bring their wives,

2573
02:52:19,264 --> 02:52:24,980
they will see that our husband doesn't respect our sister-in-law, so why should we?

2574
02:52:25,060 --> 02:52:27,980
So that will be double trouble for you in the long run.

2575
02:52:28,060 --> 02:52:34,980
So I would say to save up and keep yourself and your daughter away from this toxic environment.

2576
02:52:35,060 --> 02:52:40,060
You did a great job, you told the salary exactly 7 times less.

2577
02:52:42,440 --> 02:52:50,350
Relations are not one sided and in Islam it is not like you are born in someone's house.

2578
02:52:53,820 --> 02:52:56,300
There is a voucher for unlimited obedient women.

2579
02:52:56,380 --> 02:53:01,118
You have to eat shoes all your life, make breakfast for your wife, iron clothes,

2580
02:53:01,198 --> 02:53:04,940
clean the house, say yes to everything and listen to the taunts.

2581
02:53:05,020 --> 02:53:07,940
This is not a metric, it is a metric of respect.

2582
02:53:08,020 --> 02:53:12,540
We think that this is respect. Servitude is one thing, respect is another thing.

2583
02:53:12,620 --> 02:53:17,225
If they have respect for you, they will even think that my sister is single,

2584
02:53:17,305 --> 02:53:19,631
single handedly raising a child.

2585
02:53:19,711 --> 02:53:21,220
You are 26 now, I guess.

2586
02:53:21,310 --> 02:53:23,230
You have a 5 year old daughter right?

2587
02:53:23,310 --> 02:53:27,230
So, if she doesn't wake up, I'll make food for her.

2588
02:53:27,310 --> 02:53:29,230
It's so difficult to make halwa puri at home.

2589
02:53:29,310 --> 02:53:35,230
I mean, it's like that thing that you got a made maid and now your mother is not in the picture.

2590
02:53:35,310 --> 02:53:38,230
Like you said, she was your shield.

2591
02:53:38,310 --> 02:53:43,230
So obviously they are going to cross their limits with you.

2592
02:53:43,310 --> 02:53:44,310
So.

2593
02:53:52,500 --> 02:53:59,820
For the time being you don't have enough means to get separated or to be brave enough.

2594
02:53:59,900 --> 02:54:03,620
Obviously in a society like Pakistan it's not easy.

2595
02:54:03,700 --> 02:54:10,020
What you can do to set boundaries is you can sit down with your parents, with your father and your brothers.

2596
02:54:10,100 --> 02:54:14,320
And you can tell them not to bring my marriage in between.

2597
02:54:14,400 --> 02:54:18,320
That was not a proper marriage to begin with. I was forced into it.

2598
02:54:18,400 --> 02:54:19,990
Or whatever it is. I was arranged into it.

2599
02:54:20,070 --> 02:54:22,990
I didn't even know the guy.

2600
02:54:23,070 --> 02:54:25,990
So please do not bring this especially in front of my daughter.

2601
02:54:26,070 --> 02:54:30,990
Because now you are her father and mother both.

2602
02:54:31,070 --> 02:54:32,990
So you are the parent.

2603
02:54:33,070 --> 02:54:38,990
If that girl sees a healthy parent in terms of how she is treated.

2604
02:54:39,070 --> 02:54:41,990
If she is treated with respect or disrespect.

2605
02:54:42,070 --> 02:54:47,070
That is going to shape her personality for the rest of her life.

2606
02:54:47,280 --> 02:54:54,315
So if she sees you being taunted and being humiliated,

2607
02:54:54,395 --> 02:55:00,000
then her development will be based on low self-esteem.

2608
02:55:00,080 --> 02:55:09,000
And then people will walk over her all her life and she would assume that this is normal because I have seen it at home that men do this.

2609
02:55:09,080 --> 02:55:14,080
So not only right now, you don't have to just protect yourself, you have to protect.

2610
02:55:14,600 --> 02:55:17,480
the future self of your daughter.

2611
02:55:17,560 --> 02:55:22,480
Because what she is observing right now, will be normalized in her version of life.

2612
02:55:22,560 --> 02:55:24,000
Because she has only seen this.

2613
02:55:24,480 --> 02:55:28,220
The film you watch will be your opinion.

2614
02:55:28,320 --> 02:55:32,180
So this is a very serious matter.

2615
02:55:32,260 --> 02:55:33,303
So I would assume,

2616
02:55:33,383 --> 02:55:40,420
I would suggest that you take her straight to her and tell her that these things will not happen from now on.

2617
02:55:42,040 --> 02:55:43,480
I will not tolerate these things.

2618
02:55:43,680 --> 02:55:49,140
There is no disrespect in this. You are just setting up your boundaries and you need to tell your father.

2619
02:55:49,220 --> 02:55:54,040
To play a father. Like you are as much of a son as he is.

2620
02:55:54,120 --> 02:56:01,560
So he needs to chime in and to protect you.

2621
02:56:03,890 --> 02:56:08,010
And who gave you the license to humiliate your brothers?

2622
02:56:08,090 --> 02:56:11,410
And that too in front of your daughter.

2623
02:56:11,490 --> 02:56:15,010
So that's very bad upbringing.

2624
02:56:15,090 --> 02:56:20,610
I mean, I don't know your mother, so I won't blame her, but entirely.

2625
02:56:20,690 --> 02:56:22,410
But your father is also there.

2626
02:56:22,490 --> 02:56:24,610
So it's their job to do these things.

2627
02:56:24,690 --> 02:56:28,010
It's not your job, but maybe you have to do it.

2628
02:56:28,090 --> 02:56:29,747
When someone has a job, when they…

2629
02:56:29,827 --> 02:56:34,347
when they don't do it, then the kids have to take their leftovers.

2630
02:56:34,427 --> 02:56:35,464
So like I said,

2631
02:56:35,544 --> 02:56:43,747
your daughter is watching and learning the treatment that she has to tolerate in life.

2632
02:56:43,827 --> 02:56:49,347
She will grow up to be a person who will tolerate a lot of things that she's not supposed to.

2633
02:56:49,427 --> 02:56:53,747
So you need to make sure you set up a good example.

2634
02:56:53,827 --> 02:56:57,227
Rest, I'm glad you have.

2635
02:56:57,800 --> 02:57:02,360
totally concealed your income and I would urge you to go much higher.

2636
02:57:02,440 --> 02:57:07,400
Take it up to 3 lakhs or even up to 1.25 lakhs, God willing.

2637
02:57:07,480 --> 02:57:11,320
Take it up to 2.5-3 lakhs and then look into an option of moving out.

2638
02:57:11,400 --> 02:57:14,920
Again, there is no disrespect in this.

2639
02:57:15,000 --> 02:57:17,920
Even after getting married, a person goes.

2640
02:57:18,000 --> 02:57:20,400
Then the family says, understand I am married.

2641
02:57:20,480 --> 02:57:22,040
Or I am married.

2642
02:57:22,120 --> 02:57:24,120
This is only to.

2643
02:57:24,730 --> 02:57:29,010
A person's house should have peace.

2644
02:57:29,090 --> 02:57:34,410
If you have peace in your house, then that house is not there.

2645
02:57:34,490 --> 02:57:35,410
That is jail.

2646
02:57:35,490 --> 02:57:38,810
So I will not tell anyone to stay in jail.

2647
02:57:38,890 --> 02:57:42,090
You are a human being. Take care of your self-esteem.

2648
02:57:42,170 --> 02:57:50,370
So, save some money, put in a committee, do anything, stop expenses and try to build a…

2649
02:57:50,910 --> 02:57:58,430
situation where you have to step out of this house and live on your own terms.

2650
02:57:58,510 --> 02:58:03,790
Raise your daughter yourself, educate her, work hard.

2651
02:58:03,870 --> 02:58:06,030
If you find someone in life, you will find it.

2652
02:58:06,110 --> 02:58:10,350
There is no guarantee or parameter for anything.

2653
02:58:10,430 --> 02:58:12,350
You have done one thing.

2654
02:58:12,430 --> 02:58:17,310
So be very strategic about your financial independence and be very strategic about it.

2655
02:58:17,390 --> 02:58:23,310
about how you want to allocate your funds.

2656
02:58:23,390 --> 02:58:32,310
So aggressive saving is something I'm going to suggest you.

2657
02:58:32,390 --> 02:58:38,310
Rest, I'm not saying that you should just pick up the stuff and leave, but be very strategic.

2658
02:58:38,390 --> 02:58:43,390
And make it your mission that from today, day one, this is what you're doing.

2659
02:58:45,400 --> 02:58:47,320
Have a 6 month plan or a 1 year plan.

2660
02:58:47,400 --> 02:58:49,320
Because this can't be the rest of your life.

2661
02:58:49,400 --> 02:58:55,320
And this can't be a life for your daughter to grow into.

2662
02:58:55,400 --> 02:58:59,320
Like she needs a loving house, she needs a peaceful house.

2663
02:58:59,400 --> 02:59:05,320
She needs a place where if she's not respected, then there's no disrespect.

2664
02:59:05,400 --> 02:59:09,320
Or in front of her eyes, there's no disrespect.

2665
02:59:09,400 --> 02:59:12,210
So that leaves a very, kids are very impressionable.

2666
02:59:12,290 --> 02:59:14,210
They are very affectionable, like a mom.

2667
02:59:14,290 --> 02:59:18,210
So her personality will be ruined for the rest of her life.

2668
02:59:18,290 --> 02:59:20,210
So this is for her.

2669
02:59:20,290 --> 02:59:22,210
And yeah.

2670
02:59:22,290 --> 02:59:26,210
Rest whatever she said, I said it for twenty thousand rupees.

2671
02:59:26,290 --> 02:59:28,210
That's my problem. You go and run your shop.

2672
02:59:28,290 --> 02:59:30,290
Which you open at one o'clock.

2673
02:59:34,180 --> 02:59:38,100
Whatever you are told, listen to it with one ear and ignore the other.

2674
02:59:38,180 --> 02:59:40,600
Don't feel it, become shameless in this matter.

2675
02:59:40,680 --> 02:59:43,180
Say yes, keep saying it, say more, how much more.

2676
02:59:52,500 --> 02:59:57,380
Your mother was not your shield, she was the moderator.

2677
02:59:57,460 --> 03:00:04,660
She moderated the house and of course it's a big loss now that she's not there.

2678
03:00:11,250 --> 03:00:16,170
But now you have to become your own shield and you have to make a shield for your daughter.

2679
03:00:16,250 --> 03:00:16,650
I am seeing this but I am not sure.

2680
03:00:16,730 --> 03:00:22,432
So that will be through a proper plan, that will be through constant confrontation,

2681
03:00:22,512 --> 03:00:25,770
arguments, fights, that will not solve the problem.

2682
03:00:25,850 --> 03:00:29,290
That will be through a strategy and you have to make that strategy yourself.

2683
03:00:29,370 --> 03:00:36,410
You have to equip yourself, you have to mould yourself in that role.

2684
03:00:39,210 --> 03:00:42,130
but this can't be my daughter's life.

2685
03:00:42,210 --> 03:00:45,130
Whatever happens, life comes once.

2686
03:00:45,210 --> 03:00:48,130
Jump into it and get into it.

2687
03:00:48,210 --> 03:00:50,130
So don't worry, it will happen, God willing.

2688
03:00:50,210 --> 03:00:56,130
I'm happy that you're learning and you're educated and you're building a life around your daughter.

2689
03:00:56,210 --> 03:01:03,130
So that's very, very, very, what do we say?

2690
03:01:03,210 --> 03:01:05,210
It's a good thing that you're not dependent.

2691
03:01:06,330 --> 03:01:11,450
You are not dependent on them, so they are treating you like this.

2692
03:01:11,530 --> 03:01:15,450
That is why I say financial independence is important.

2693
03:01:15,530 --> 03:01:23,450
Otherwise, you are a man from outside, your father and brother are treating you like this.

2694
03:01:23,530 --> 03:01:27,450
That is why it is important, my sisters, that I keep saying.

2695
03:01:27,530 --> 03:01:32,870
Otherwise, for every penny, you will have to face such people that you will start hating yourself.

2696
03:01:32,950 --> 03:01:38,870
I will start feeling that I have to beg in front of such a person.

2697
03:01:38,950 --> 03:01:44,950
That's not a life worth living. Honestly. Take care. Many blessings for you.

2698
03:01:45,430 --> 03:01:48,297
Alright, next question is from our patrons.

2699
03:01:48,377 --> 03:01:50,578
They are always given preference.

2700
03:01:50,658 --> 03:01:55,553
So if you want to support this channel, you can do that on patreon.com.

2701
03:01:55,633 --> 03:01:57,700
Really appreciate your support.

2702
03:01:58,660 --> 03:01:59,580
Support.

2703
03:01:59,660 --> 03:02:04,580
Question about confidence, belonging and being a Pakistani abroad.

2704
03:02:04,660 --> 03:02:05,334
Hi, Junaid Bhai.

2705
03:02:05,414 --> 03:02:07,581
First of all, thank you for everything you do.

2706
03:02:07,661 --> 03:02:10,568
I really appreciate how honest and practical your advice is,

2707
03:02:10,648 --> 03:02:12,580
especially in the Ask Anjit Swaik series.

2708
03:02:12,660 --> 03:02:16,879
I wanted to ask you something that has been on my mind for quite some time.

2709
03:02:16,959 --> 03:02:19,108
A little background about me.

2710
03:02:19,188 --> 03:02:20,812
I am originally from Pakistan.

2711
03:02:20,892 --> 03:02:24,181
I spent almost seven years living in Budapest.

2712
03:02:24,261 --> 03:02:25,560
Have I been to Budapest?

2713
03:02:26,440 --> 03:02:30,640
I've been to Budapest, Prague.

2714
03:02:32,500 --> 03:02:33,242
I'm into Prague.

2715
03:02:33,322 --> 03:02:36,704
First as a student and then as a software engineer.

2716
03:02:36,784 --> 03:02:38,995
Recently my company relocated me to Canada.

2717
03:02:39,075 --> 03:02:44,940
One thing I've noticed is that sometimes I feel socially different in Western environments such as restaurants,

2718
03:02:45,020 --> 03:02:48,442
pubs, bars or social gatherings, especially when I'm there alone.

2719
03:02:48,522 --> 03:02:50,269
The people are generally friendly.

2720
03:02:50,349 --> 03:02:57,275
Nobody's treating me badly yet internally I sometimes feel and become self conscious or wonder whether I really belong there.

2721
03:02:57,355 --> 03:02:59,460
I also noticed that when I see a

2722
03:02:59,540 --> 03:03:01,249
When I see attractive local women,

2723
03:03:01,329 --> 03:03:07,008
my brain sometimes starts wondering whether people like me are seen differently because I am a Pakistani,

2724
03:03:07,088 --> 03:03:11,572
especially given the stereotypes South Asians sometimes face in the Western countries.

2725
03:03:11,652 --> 03:03:16,126
Rationally, I know not everyone thinks that way, but the feeling still appears sometimes.

2726
03:03:16,206 --> 03:03:21,510
The interesting part is that objectively, I don't think this comes from my appearance.

2727
03:03:21,590 --> 03:03:27,110
I've received many compliments on my looks from my past girlfriends and female friends because I spent years.

2728
03:03:27,190 --> 03:03:31,973
years with Italian friends and naturally picked up their style of dressing, mannerisms,

2729
03:03:32,053 --> 03:03:37,780
and even some of the accent and people occasionally assume I'm Italian before they know where I'm from.

2730
03:03:38,610 --> 03:03:42,743
That made me think, if I sometimes feel this way despite having those experiences,

2731
03:03:42,823 --> 03:03:49,700
how much harder might it feel for an average Pakistani or an Indian guy who doesn't have those same experiences or confidence?

2732
03:03:50,390 --> 03:03:54,780
Have you ever experienced anything similar while traveling through Europe or North America?

2733
03:03:54,970 --> 03:03:59,190
When you walk into a restaurant, a pub, a nightclub or a cafe completely alone,

2734
03:03:59,270 --> 03:04:02,048
surrounded by locals, do you ever feel the following?

2735
03:04:02,128 --> 03:04:03,281
You feel out of place?

2736
03:04:03,361 --> 03:04:04,357
Do you feel judged?

2737
03:04:04,437 --> 03:04:06,348
Or do you feel less socially accepted?

2738
03:04:06,428 --> 03:04:09,206
Or is that something you've never really experienced?

2739
03:04:09,286 --> 03:04:14,091
If you did experience it earlier in life, how did your thinking change over time?

2740
03:04:14,171 --> 03:04:18,339
Also from your experience of meeting thousands of Pakistanis around the world,

2741
03:04:18,419 --> 03:04:22,390
do you think this feeling is common among us or do you think it's more of a

2742
03:04:22,470 --> 03:04:27,311
more of an individual psychological issue rather than something cultural.

2743
03:04:27,391 --> 03:04:32,638
I generally love to hear your perspective because you've traveled extensively,

2744
03:04:32,718 --> 03:04:37,494
met people from many cultures and seem very comfortable wherever you go.

2745
03:04:37,574 --> 03:04:42,154
Thank you and I hope this question makes it to Ask Anjeeswax someday.

2746
03:04:42,234 --> 03:04:43,667
So as you saw,

2747
03:04:43,747 --> 03:04:49,840
he is a brother who lived in Budapest for seven years and then relocated to Canada.

